  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2802.07 Recommendation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2802.07 “Recommendation” means the report issued by a hearings examiner following an administrative review or hearing specified in RSA 265-A:31, III. The term includes “ruling” as used in RSA 265-A:33 and these rules.\n\nSource. #8782-A, eff 1-1-07 (formerly Saf-C 2801.04); ss by #10888, eff 7-16-15 (from Saf-C 2802.05)",
